      "payload": {
        "name": "search_knowledge",
        "call_id": "knowledge-inject",
        "phase": "bootstrap",
        "output_summary": "{\"method\": \"hybrid\", \"embedding_model\": \"BAAI/bge-m3\", \"embedding_revision\": \"5617a9f61b028005a4858fdac845db406aefb181\", \"chunks\": [{\"chunk_id\": \"reviewed_orders\", \"source\": \"kb/metrics.md\", \"content\": \"reviewed_orders 已评价订单／多少单获得评价\\n按订单计算是否存在评价，不能用评价行数代替订单数。一个订单可能有多条评价。\\n```sql\\nSELECT count(*) AS reviewed_orders FROM orders o WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM order_reviews r WHERE r.order_id=o.order_id);\\n```\", \"content_sha256\": \"eefe3ba0f4afd1e775438ff89b1a326781eaa6f4b2ae4285f171e55a871fdbc2\"}, {\"chunk_id\": \"paid_sales\", \"source\": \"kb/metrics.md\", \"content\": \"paid_sales 已付款订单的商品销售额／收到付款的订单\\n先用 EXISTS 筛选至少有一条 payment 的订单，再求商品价格总和，保留全部状态且不含运费。不得直接 JOIN 支付明细再 SUM 商品金额，一单多次付款会放大金额。\\n```sql\\nSELECT sum(i.price) AS paid_sales FROM order_items i WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM order_payments p WHERE p.order_id=i.order_id);\\n```\", \"content_sha256\": \"19ca90b0d0c9a60866923b9cae648ce114f7c2b4304bd7b8264fbc4fb39665ff\"}, {\"chunk_id\": \"sales\", \"source\": \"kb/metrics.md\", \"content\": \"sales 商品销售额／商品卖了多少钱／商品金额\\n商品销售额为 order_items.price 之和，不含运费，默认保留所有订单状态。此指标与排除 canceled/unavailable 的 GMV 不同。问题明确状态时依问题。\\n```sql\\nSELECT sum(price) AS sales FROM order_items;\\n```\", \"content_sha256\": \"6ea984cdaf4c7e770e7e786e5c66c1c1484f38039aa66d1d562a9073aca2d290\"}]}",
        "error": null,
        "result_id": null
      },
